{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pastel-day","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pastel Day","description":"A soft light theme with pastel lavender and mint syntax colors.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Pastel Day","path":"themes/pastel-day.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/pastel-day.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Pastel Day\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fbfaff\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#35324a\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#f1eff9\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#e9e6f5\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#e9e6f5\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#f1eff9\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e4e0f3\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d9d3f0\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#f1eff9\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#dcd7ee\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#7c5cd6\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#7c5cd6\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#7c5cd6\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d9d3f0\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e4e0f380\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#7c5cd6\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#dcd7ee\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#c43d6b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#2f8f6b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#b5780b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#c43d6b\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9d97b8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2f8f6b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c2570c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7c5cd6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#1f7fa6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#3b6fd4\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c2570c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#1f7fa6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c43d6b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b5780b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2f8f6b\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pastel Day\n\nA soft light theme with pastel lavender and mint syntax colors.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Pastel Day** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fbfaff` |\n| Text | `#35324a` |\n| Accent | `#7c5cd6` |\n| Keywords | `#7c5cd6` |\n| Strings | `#2f8f6b` |\n| Functions | `#3b6fd4` |\n| Types | `#1f7fa6` |\n| Comments | `#9d97b8` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}